15	COMMENT ON COLUMN station.pressure_low_limit_mpa IS '管网压力下限MPa，恰等限值判定合格';
16	COMMENT ON COLUMN station.pressure_high_limit_mpa IS '管网压力上限MPa，恰等限值判定合格';
17	COMMENT ON COLUMN station.pressure_target_mpa IS '调压回归目标压力MPa';
18	COMMENT ON COLUMN station.target_concentration_mg_m3 IS '末端加臭目标浓度mg/m3，默认20';
19	COMMENT ON COLUMN station.concentration_tolerance_pct IS '浓度允许偏差百分比，默认20%';
